118
00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:30.869
Mark Blackman: So, what, the team and, Rohit in particular, have done.

119
00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:41.259
Mark Blackman: is… is innovate to enable BLS to have weighted shares that could accommodate our consensus weight. So…

120
00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:54.789
Mark Blackman: The other aspect of it is the hints algorithm, which is really to associate the weighted shares. And then lastly, as Richard mentioned, we have the address book, the recursive.

